:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=CHGDEVD.Change Device Description (CHGDEVD)
:P.Use the Change Device Description (CHGDEVD) command to change the
attributes that every device description has, whatever its category.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/DEVD'.Device description (DEVD)
:P.The device description.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/ONLINE'.Online at IPL (ONLINE)
:P.Whether the device or line is varied on when the system starts (IPL).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.It is varied on at IPL.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.It stays varied off until someone varies it on.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/MSGQ'.Message queue (MSGQ)
:P.The message queue that receives the messages the command or the
object sends.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSOPR:EPK.
:PD.QSYSOPR, the system operator's message queue.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/PRTDEV'.Print device (PRTDEV)
:P.The printer device the spooled output prints on.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/OUTQ'.Output queue (OUTQ)
:P.The output queue the spooled files go to.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DEV:EPK.
:PD.The value of the device.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDEVD/TEXT'.Description (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The text does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.No text.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGNETA.Change Network Attributes (CHGNETA)
:P.Use the Change Network Attributes (CHGNETA) command to change the
network attributes; every one defaults to *SAME.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/SYSNAME'.System name (SYSNAME)
:P.The system name for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/LCLNETID'.Local network ID (LCLNETID)
:P.The local network ID for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/LCLCPNAME'.Local control point name (LCLCPNAME)
:P.The local control point name for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/LCLLOCNAME'.Default local location (LCLLOCNAME)
:P.The local location name this system uses on the connection.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/DFTMODE'.Default mode (DFTMODE)
:P.The default mode for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/NODETYPE'.APPN node type (NODETYPE)
:P.The APPN node type for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ENDNODE, *NETNODE, *LENNODE, *BEXNODE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/DTACPR'.Data compression (DTACPR)
:P.Whether the data is compressed as it is written.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 8 characters. The value must be from 1 to 2147483647.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ALLOW, *REQUEST, *REQUIRE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/DTACPRINM'.Intermediate data compression (DTACPRINM)
:P.The intermediate data compression for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 8 characters. The value must be from 1 to 2147483647.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ALLOW, *REQUEST, *REQUIRE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/MAXINTSSN'.Max intermediate sessions (MAXINTSSN)
:P.The max intermediate sessions for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 9999.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/RAR'.Route addition resistance (RAR)
:P.The route addition resistance for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 255.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/NETSERVER'.Network node servers (NETSERVER)
:P.The network node servers for this command.
:P.Up to 5 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Network ID
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 9 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LCLNETID.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Control point name
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRSTS'.Alert status (ALRSTS)
:P.The alert status for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ON:EPK.
:PD.On.
:PT.:PK.*OFF:EPK.
:PD.Off.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *UNATTEND.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRPRIFP'.Alert primary focal point (ALRPRIFP)
:P.The alert primary focal point for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRDFTFP'.Alert default focal point (ALRDFTFP)
:P.The alert default focal point for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRLOGSTS'.Alert logging status (ALRLOGSTS)
:P.The alert logging status for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*LOCAL:EPK.
:PD.This system.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *RCV.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRBCKFP'.Alert backup focal point (ALRBCKFP)
:P.The alert backup focal point for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Network ID
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 9 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LCLNETID.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Control point name
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALRRQSFP'.Alert focal point to request (ALRRQSFP)
