:P.The network server domain for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*SYSNAME:EPK.
:PD.The system name.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALWVRTIP'.Allow virtual APPN support (ALWVRTIP)
:P.The allow virtual APPN support for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALWHPRTWR'.Allow HPR transport tower (ALWHPRTWR)
:P.The allow HPR transport tower for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/VRTAUTODEV'.Virtual autocreate devices (VRTAUTODEV)
:P.The virtual autocreate devices for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 254.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/HPRPTHTMR'.HPR path switch timers (HPRPTHTMR)
:P.The HPR path switch timers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 4 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Network priority
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10000.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. High priority
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10000.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 3&colon. Medium priority
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10000.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 4&colon. Low priority
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10000.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNETA/ALWADDCLU'.Allow add to cluster (ALWADDCLU)
:P.The allow add to cluster for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
