:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CRTDEVDSP.Create Device Desc (Display) (CRTDEVDSP)
:P.Use the Create Device Desc (Display) (CRTDEVDSP) command to create a
display device description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/DEVD'.Device description (DEVD)
:P.The device description.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/DEVCLS'.Device class (DEVCLS)
:P.The device class for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*LCL:EPK.
:PD.Local.
:PT.:PK.*RMT:EPK.
:PD.Remote.
:PT.:PK.*VRT:EPK.
:PD.Virtual.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SNPT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/TYPE'.Device type (TYPE)
:P.The device type for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:P.The value must be one of the values F4 lists.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/MODEL'.Device model (MODEL)
:P.The device model for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:EPARML.
:P.The value must be one of the values F4 lists.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/PORT'.Port number (PORT)
:P.The TCP or UDP port number.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 17.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/SWTSET'.Switch setting (SWTSET)
:P.The switch setting for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 6.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/SHRSSNNBR'.Shared session number (SHRSSNNBR)
:P.The shared session number for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 3.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/LOCADR'.Local location address (LOCADR)
:P.The local location address for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 2 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/RMTLOCNAME'.Remote location (RMTLOCNAME)
:P.The remote location name of the system at the other end of the
connection.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/ONLINE'.Online at IPL (ONLINE)
:P.Whether the device or line is varied on when the system starts (IPL).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*YES:EPK.
:PD.It is varied on at IPL.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.It stays varied off until someone varies it on.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/CTL'.Attached controller (CTL)
:P.The attached controller for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/KBDTYPE'.Keyboard language type (KBDTYPE)
:P.The keyboard language type for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 7 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/DROP'.Drop line at signoff (DROP)
:P.Whether to drop line at signoff.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/ALWBLN'.Allow blinking cursor (ALWBLN)
:P.Whether to allow blinking cursor.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/PRTDEV'.Print device (PRTDEV)
:P.The printer device the spooled output prints on.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/OUTQ'.Output queue (OUTQ)
:P.The output queue the spooled files go to.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*DEV:EPK.
:PD.The value of the device.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/PRTFILE'.Printer file (PRTFILE)
:P.The printer file the printed output is written with, by name and
library.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, QSYSPRT is used.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTDEVDSP/WSCST'.Workstation customizing (WSCST)
