:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPDEVD/OPTION'.Option (OPTION)
:P.The option for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*BASIC:EPK.
:PD.Basic.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MODE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPDEVD/OUTPUT'.Output (OUTPUT)
:P.Where the command sends what it produces&colon. to the display of an
interactive job, or to a spooled file of the job's printer file. Some
commands can also write it to a database file.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*:EPK.
:PD.The output is shown at the display of an interactive job, and
printed for a batch job.
:PT.:PK.*PRINT:EPK.
:PD.The output is printed with the job's spooled output.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPNETA.Display Network Attributes (DSPNETA)
:P.Use the Display Network Attributes (DSPNETA) command to show the
network attributes.
:EHELP.
