:HELP NAME=WRKDEVD.Work with Device Descriptions (WRKDEVD)
:P.Use the Work with Device Descriptions (WRKDEVD) command to list
device descriptions and work with them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKDEVD/DEVD'.Device description (DEVD)
:P.The device description.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*HOST:EPK.
:PD.A host route&colon. the address names a single host.
:PT.:PV.generic-name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters, or a generic name&colon.
characters that end with an asterisk (*) select every name that starts
with them.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *APPC, *ASC, *BSC, *CMN, *CRP, *DKT, *DSP, *FNC,
*INTRA, *LWS, *MLB, *NET, *OPT, *PRT, *RTL, *SNPT, *SNUF, *TAP, *VWS.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
